\r\n  Painting, </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lining, Sign </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">and Design<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">8. Wall\r\n  Hanging, Colour Mixing/Matching and Glazing<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">9. Graphic\r\n  Design<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">10. Graphic\r\n  Printing<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">11. Ceramics<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">12. Basic Electricity.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">13. General\r\n  Wood work<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"margin-left:20.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  text-indent:-20.3pt;line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">14.\r\n  General Metal Work<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"margin-left:20.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  text-indent:-20.3pt;line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">15.\r\n  Men/Ladies Garment Construction &amp; Finishing<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"margin-left:20.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  text-indent:-20.3pt;line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">16.\r\n  Spinning 16. Weaving<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"margin-left:20.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  text-indent:-20.3pt;line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">17.\r\n  Men/Ladies Textile Design<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"margin-left:20.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  text-indent:-20.3pt;line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">18.SurfaceDesign\r\n  &amp; Printing<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"margin-left:20.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  text-indent:-20.3pt;line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">19.&nbsp; Bleaching, Dyeing and Finishing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"margin-left:20.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  text-indent:-20.3pt;line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\">20.\r\n  Spraying, Painting, Lining, Sign and Design<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas1\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>",
